                                                                                
 Usage: python -m aeep serve [OPTIONS]                                          
                                                                                
 Expose AEEP as an MCP server for ChatGPT/Codex, Claude, or OpenClaw.           
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --profile                       <str>                 legacy, assessment, or │
│                                                       task (no assessment    │
│                                                       controls)              │
│                                                       [default: legacy]      │
│ --task-scope                    <str>                 Operator-reviewed task │
│                                                       scope ID; never a tool │
│                                                       argument.              │
│ --transport                     <str>                 stdio or http          │
│                                                       [default: stdio]       │
│ --manifest              -m      <path>                [env var:              │
│                                                       AEEP_MANIFEST]         │
│ --approve                       <none|read|write|des  Operator-controlled    │
│                                 tructive|financial>   approval ceiling for   │
│                                                       MCP tool execution.    │
│                                                       [default: read]        │
│ --approve-unsafe-exec…                                                       │
│ --host                          <str>                 [default: 127.0.0.1]   │
│ --port                          <int range>           [default: 8765]        │
│                                 [1<=x<=65535]                                │
│ --token-env                     <str>                 [default:              │
│                                                       AEEP_BEARER_TOKEN]     │
│ --help                                                Show this message and  │
│                                                       exit.                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

